  "functions": [
    {
      "id": "SEC015-FN-01",
      "name": "assess_identity",
      "signature": "assess_identity(record: AssetRecordInput, source_qualification: SourceQualification) -> IdentityAssessment",
      "reads": [
        "record.owner.presence",
        "record.owner.value",
        "record.owner.null_marker",
        "record.asset_label.presence",
        "record.asset_label.value",
        "record.asset_label.null_marker",
        "record.source.presence",
        "record.source.value",
        "record.source.null_marker",
        "record.revision.presence",
        "record.revision.value",
        "record.revision.null_marker",
        "record.digest.presence",
        "record.digest.value",
        "record.digest.null_marker",
        "record.stable_asset_identity.presence",
        "record.stable_asset_identity.value",
        "record.stable_asset_identity.null_marker",
        "record.identity_resolution.presence",
        "record.identity_resolution.value",
        "record.identity_resolution.null_marker",
        "record.classification_reference.presence",
        "record.classification_reference.value.state",
        "record.classification_reference.value.value",
        "record.classification_reference.value.source_owner.presence",
        "record.classification_reference.value.source_owner.value",
        "record.classification_reference.value.source_revision.presence",
        "record.classification_reference.value.source_revision.value",
        "record.classification_reference.null_marker",
        "record.content_dump_present.presence",
        "record.content_dump_present.value",
        "record.content_dump_present.null_marker",
        "source_qualification"
      ],
      "returns": [
        "identity_state",
        "identity_value",
        "identity_resolution_value",
        "asset_label_value",
        "provenance_state",
        "owner_value",
        "source_value",
        "revision_value",
        "digest_value",
        "content_dump_present",
        "classification_state",
        "classification_source_owner",
        "classification_source_revision",
        "classification_claim_value",
        "source_qualification",
        "return_owner",
        "reason_codes"
      ],
      "algorithm": [
        "1. owner/source/revision/digest/identity/classificationのpresenceタグをそのまま読む。",
        "2. stable identity resolutionがunknown、stable identityがabsent/null、または必須provenance値（owner/source/revision/digest）がabsent/nullなら、対応するidentity/provenance状態とreasonを記録する。null/absentを値へ補完しない。ownerのabsent/nullはowner_absent/owner_nullで区別する。",
        "3. identity_resolution=conflictまたは識別項目間の明示的相反をconflictにする。",
        "4. 1–3以外はidentified_synthetic_or_unqualified / linked_record_values。ただしsource_qualificationを引き上げない。",
        "5. classification_referenceのstate/valueとsource_owner/source_revisionを対応fieldへそのまま保持する。state=conflictはconflict、state=unknownはunknown。L4 identity_flowの「不足・不整合・分類不能はunknown/unclassifiedのまま保つ」とL10-F01-N01のunknown identityをpublicへしない期待に従い、identity_state=unknownならstate=knownの分類claimもclassification_state=unknownとしてclassification_unqualifiedを記録し、claim値自体は保持して資格に昇格しない。identityがunknownでなく分類state=knownならknown claimとして保持する。source_owner/source_revisionのpresenceやasset revisionとの一致は分類成立・資格条件にしない。",
        "6. content_dump_presentをpresence/valueごと返す。identity/provenanceの不足・相反があるときはownerの元presence（absent/null/value）をreturn_ownerへ保持し、identity/provenanceの不足・相反がなければreturn_owner=absentとする。どちらも返送先候補の値であり、実送信・権限ではない。"
      ],
      "preconditions": [
        "recordはAssetRecordInputの全FieldValue wrapperを持ち、各supplied valueが宣言型/domain内である。source_qualificationはSourceQualificationの宣言値である。raw JSONのparsing/castingは本関数の責務外。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC015-FN-02",
      "name": "assess_claims",
      "signature": "assess_claims(identity: IdentityAssessment, context: ProtectionContext) -> ClaimAssessment",
      "reads": [
        "context.identity_base_state",
        "context.identity_requires_content_dump",
        "context.inventory_scope",
        "context.public_authorization",
        "context.publication_authorization",
        "context.scope_comparison",
        "context.scope_comparison.presence",
        "context.scope_comparison.value.additional_candidate_records.presence",
        "context.scope_comparison.value.additional_candidate_records.value",
        "context.web_operation",
        "context.web_protection_state",
        "identity.classification_claim_value",
        "identity.classification_state",
        "identity.content_dump_present",
        "identity.return_owner"
      ],
      "returns": [
        "identity_base_state",
        "web_protection_state",
        "web_operation",
        "public_authorization",
        "publication_authorization",
        "content_dump_required",
        "inventory_scope",
        "scope_comparison",
        "return_owner",
        "claim_consistency"
      ],
      "algorithm": [
        "1. contextの各FieldValue（presence/value/null marker）とidentity.return_ownerを別々に出力へ写す。identity値から保護・運用・許可状態を推定しない。absent/nullは原tagを保ち、unknownへ正規化しない。",
        "2. contextの各claimはそれぞれ単独に評価する。scope_comparisonのpresence/valueは他のclaimの評価をgateしない。",
        "3. web_protection_state=established_claim、またはweb_operation=performed_claimならinventory_does_not_establish_protectionを記録する。",
        "4. public_authorizationまたはpublication_authorizationがgranted_from_identity_onlyならidentity_does_not_grant_publicationを記録する。",
        "5. identity_base_state=blocked_until_all_pattern_capabilitiesならpattern_completion_not_required_for_1_0を記録する。",
        "6. inventory_scope=listed_onlyの場合に限ってcontext.scope_comparisonを読む。presence=valueかつadditional_candidate_records.presence=valueでvalue.itemsが1件以上ならunlisted_scope_omittedを記録する。ちょうど1件の追加recordでowner.presence=valueなら、そのpresence付きownerをClaimAssessment.return_ownerへ写す。ownerがabsent/nullならそのtagを保つ。複数recordでは一件目を選ばずidentity.return_ownerを保持し、全recordとownerをscope_comparisonに残して単一返送先未解決とする。scope比較欠落/null/空ではfindingを出さず、identity.return_ownerを保持する。",
        "7. identity_requires_content_dump=trueかつidentity.content_dump_present=falseならcontent_dump_not_requiredを記録する。",
        "8. identity.classification_claim_valueがvalueかつidentity.classification_state=unknownならclassification_reference_unqualifiedを記録する。元のknown identity値は保持し、unknown identityをpublicへ昇格しない。"
      ],
      "preconditions": [
        "identityはIdentityAssessment、contextはProtectionContextの全fieldを持つ型付き論理値である。raw JSON型検査や型外値のcastはこの関数の責務外である。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC015-FN-03",
      "name": "render_identity_view",
      "signature": "render_identity_view(identity: IdentityAssessment, claims: ClaimAssessment) -> IdentityView",
      "reads": [
        "claims.claim_consistency",
        "claims.content_dump_required",
        "claims.identity_base_state",
        "claims.inventory_scope",
        "claims.public_authorization",
        "claims.publication_authorization",
        "claims.return_owner",
        "claims.web_operation",
        "claims.web_protection_state",
        "identity.asset_label_value",
        "identity.classification_claim_value",
        "identity.classification_source_owner",
        "identity.classification_source_revision",
        "identity.classification_state",
        "identity.content_dump_present",
        "identity.digest_value",
        "identity.identity_resolution_value",
        "identity.identity_state",
        "identity.identity_value",
        "identity.owner_value",
        "identity.provenance_state",
        "identity.reason_codes",
        "identity.return_owner",
        "identity.revision_value",
        "identity.source_qualification",
        "identity.source_value"
      ],
      "returns": [
        "identity_state_text",
        "identity_resolution_text",
        "asset_label_text",
        "provenance_text",
        "qualification_text",
        "classification_text",
        "protection_text",
        "return_owner_text"
      ],
      "algorithm": [
        "identity_state_textはidentity.identity_stateをidentified_synthetic_or_unqualified→「識別: 合成または未資格の記録値」、unknown→「識別: unknown」、conflict→「識別: conflict」へ写す。",
        "identity_resolution_textとasset_label_textはFieldValueをfield名: absent / field名: null / field名: value=<原値>の形式で表示する。provenance_textはprovenance: <state>; owner/source/revision/digestの各fieldを同形式で並べる。",
        "qualification_textはsource_qualification enumをnot_claimed→「資格: 未申告」、self_declared→「資格: 自己申告（未検証）」、qualified_by_external_contract→「資格: 外部契約による申告（実資格未確認）」へ写し、識別成立の文言と結合しない。",
        "classification_textはclassification_stateをknown→「分類claim: known」、unknown→「分類claim: unknown」、conflict→「分類claim: conflict」へ写し、unknownをpublicへ置換しない。",
        "protection_textはweb_protection_state/web_operation/publication_authorizationを上記FieldValue形式で並べ、末尾にclaim_consistency=[<順序を保ったfinding token列>]を付ける。identity_base_stateから保護や公開を推論しない。",
        "return_owner_textはClaimAssessment.return_ownerのpresence/value/null markerを区別して表示し、単一追加候補の返送先値を含む。identity側の別owner値へ戻さない。"
      ],
      "preconditions": [
        "identityはIdentityAssessment、claimsはClaimAssessmentの型付き論理値である。説明表示のためにraw JSONを再解釈しない。"
      ]
    }
  ],
